Synchronic data licences
========================

The code in this repository is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). Data is licensed
separately, by origin:

1. Curated data — everything under data/overrides/ and data/policy/
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
   Attribution: "Synchronic contributors".

2. Data derived from Wikidata — everything under data/raw/
   Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal, as upstream.
   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

   The pipeline's output under data/merged/ combines 1 and 2: the records it
   takes from Wikidata are CC0, and the curated parts carried into it (states,
   lanes, ids, titles, flags, corrections) are CC BY-SA 4.0.

3. Wikipedia excerpts
   CC BY-SA, attributed in the interface next to each excerpt.

4. Flags from Wikimedia Commons
   Licensed per file. Each flag record stores its own `license` and
   `attribution`.

5. Historical border snapshots
   Licensed per source; none are included yet.
